# Local dev (`pnpm dev`) writes .env.local for you. It contains an anonymous
# local deployment and VITE_CONVEX_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3210. Do not commit it.
#
# Self-hosted dev (`pnpm dev:self-hosted`) writes .env.selfhosted.local with
# the admin key. Do not commit that file either. The public URL the Vite
# self-hosted mode uses is in .env.selfhosted.
